/> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T07:34:21-08:00","id":1354768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352224-martial-arts-compatibility?p=1354719#post1354719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Come on man. SP grants a second Initiative pool to attack with. Righteous Devil let's you use your Charisma and Presence to impose Defining Ties of Repentance. <br /> <br /> White Reaper Halos. Silver Voiced artifact shouts. Ebon Shadow stealth tricks. Tiger Style bonus damage and rush. Every style has a &amp;quot;thing&amp;quot; that makes it a Martial Art. What's the &amp;quot;Thing&amp;quot; of Celestial Monkey?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhatever thing the writers give it to make it special\u201d, obviously. Just like they did for Falcon Style, which otherwise would just be Brawl/Athletics. Ebon Shadow would just be Brawl/Stealth.<br /> <br /> Asking what any martial art could have to offer that Ability-based Charms don\u2019t is always a stupid question. Either someone has an idea, or someone is looking for the idea.<br /> <br /> Would you have had the idea for Single Point\u2019s second Initiative track? Or White Reaper\u2019s halos? Or did those only seem obvious to you after you learned of them?<br /> <br /> Were they obvious to you before you learned of them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T16:50:21-08:00","id":1354831,"title":"","content":"Woah man, calm down this hostility. It was an innocent question, because I don't know anything about CM. It's not an attack on you. I'm just curious what kind of unique things Celestial Monkey does, like how in 2e, Dreaming Pearl Courtesan let you make weapons out of silk sashes, tea cups, and brushes. And of course GazelleCarp. That's a unique idea. <br /> <br /> An easy enough answer is &quot;we don't know yet, but its really good at jumping around and taunting people/cheapshots/xyz&quot;. <br /> <br /> This is not a personal attack on you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T05:48:38-08:00","id":1354881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352224-martial-arts-compatibility?p=1354831#post1354831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woah man, calm down this hostility. It was an innocent question</div> </div> </div> </div>Your first, maybe. Your second?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't know anything about CM. It's not an attack on you. I'm just curious what kind of unique things Celestial Monkey does, like how in 2e, Dreaming Pearl Courtesan let you make weapons out of silk sashes, tea cups, and brushes. And of course GazelleCarp. That's a unique idea. </div> </div> </div>Celestial Monkey had a consistent theme of fighting smarter rather than harder. It made it possible to ambush someone with your first attack in plain sight, it helped you study your opponent to counter them more easily, it let you disable them, it let you hit their weak spots.<br /> <br /> The Form had nothing to do with fighting, and the Capstone had far too much with trying to be Great Sage Sun Wukong The Immortal Stone Monkey than sticking with &quot;emulate a monkey with a staff&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T07:19:16-08:00","id":1354887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352224-martial-arts-compatibility?p=1354881#post1354881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your first, maybe. Your second?</div> </div> </div> </div>...still read as innocent, to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T14:36:15-08:00","id":1354927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352224-martial-arts-compatibility?p=1354881#post1354881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your first, maybe. Your second?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Celestial Monkey had a consistent theme of fighting smarter rather than harder. It made it possible to ambush someone with your first attack in plain sight, it helped you study your opponent to counter them more easily, it let you disable them, it let you hit their weak spots.<br /> <br /> The Form had nothing to do with fighting, and the Capstone had far too much with trying to be Great Sage Sun Wukong The Immortal Stone Monkey than sticking with &amp;quot;emulate a monkey with a staff&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds like cool style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-16T06:22:23-08:00","id":1355167,"title":"","content":"I made a Chosen of Journeys with Celestial Monkey Style in Ex2.5... She could determine when an opponent was going to attack and choose to attack first.. It was weird, but fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com